            <change when="2026-07-24" xml:id="ai-merge">
                <persName>Claude (auto-merge)</persName> Merged AI-extracted description from
                manual/ai/single_match/F_54_2.xml (checked by Seonoo Kim, 2026-03-12) into the
                existing Fihrist record. Added physDesc measurements/layout/script and a descriptive
                note about the volume's contents. NOTE FOR CATALOGUER: the AI source's summary field
                was a duplicate/copy-paste of F_54.1's description (wrong volume) and was NOT used;
                its item-level note describing this volume was used instead. The AI source is also
                internally inconsistent about this volume's date (origin field: 22 Jumáda I, 1331/3
                May 1913; item note: 25 Jumáda I, 1331/May 3, 1913) and extent (physDesc: 548 ff.;
                item note: "440 pp."); neither discrepancy has been resolved here and both need
                verification against the printed Nicholson catalogue. Not yet reviewed by a
                cataloguer. </change>
